      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "A physically grounded retro-industrial future. Heavy manufactured steel, ceramic armor, rubber seals, smoked glass and canvas. Broad geometric primary masses, functional joints and hydraulics, quiet armor plates with detail clustered at mechanisms. Visible maintenance, chipped paint and purposeful wear. Electromechanical technology, physical switches and phosphor instruments. Roughly 70 percent primary forms, 20 percent secondary structure, 10 percent surface detail. Structural neutrals dominate with small functional saturated accents."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
      "title": "STYLE / rendering",
      "pos": [
        0,
        400
      ],
      "size": [
        430,
        350
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "STRING",
          "type": "STRING",
          "links": [
            2
          ]
        }
      ],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "A hand-painted late-1980s to early-1990s Japanese science-fiction OVA animation frame. Painted gouache backgrounds, selective precise ink lines, hard cel shadow shapes in three value groups, graphic painted metal highlights, restrained gradients and subtle analog grain. Tactile illustrated material weight and clear silhouettes. One coherent finished scene, no collage, no captions or watermark. Avoid glossy CGI, photographic rendering, holograms and indiscriminate tiny panel detail."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
      "title": "GEOGRAPHY / candidate",
      "pos": [
        0,
        800
      ],
      "size": [
        430,
        350
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 2,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [
